==Appearance==
<tabber>
|-|Default=
Coal is a dark grey dog-like rock the shape and size of a boulder, with four dark, stubby legs, a similarly rock-like tail and blackish snowflake marks on her cheeks. Her dark eyelids form a bored, tired, somewhat cross expression on her face, having dark circles under her eyes (which pop out like {{CI|Pebble|name=true}}'s but not as intensely) and thick, furrowed, darker squarish brows. Her nose is also somewhat squarish. She wears a red two-sided satchel over her back with darker stitches on the flap and strap, triangle-shaped closures colored dark yellow with lighter stripes making them appear shiny, and pinkish bars striped with three white diagonal lines. She has a shiny yellow flag pole similar to her closures and is on the right side of her head and bears a white, triangular flag with a pinkish snowflake design on the front and back, similar to the marks on her face which is positioned so low on her that it makes her forehead appear large.
|-|Vintage=
Vintage Coal is now a very dark gray with her legs and eyebrows being the same color as the rest of her body and has even darker face markings and eyes pie-cut on opposite ends. Her satchel is light gray with slightly darker stitching, the same darker shade of gray as her closures and flag pole which have light gray shines. The bars on her satchel are black, as well as the snowflakes on her flag.
|-|Pretty Present=
Pretty Present Coal is a deep shade of royal purple with darker heart-shaped cheek marks, the same color of her eyebrows, eyelids, eye bags, and legs. Towards the left of her forehead, she sports a loopy, flower-shaped, bow colored pink with two yellow tails, and sports and inversely colored bow towards the right. She has a ribbon with pink and yellow stripes that is tied into a large bow on top of her with long, curved tails sticking out from the center.
|-|Snowy Rescue=
Snowy Rescue Coal is tan colored and has a splotch of white snow on her back and tail. Her cheeks are cross-shaped and a darker tan like her eyebrows, eyelids, and feet. There are now brownish-orange barrels with two brown bilge hoops and heads that are attached to a vermillion strap with white fluff on the sides. There are vermillion squares with six white dots arranged in a circle on the sides of the barrels. This pattern is also present of her flag of the same vermillion color that has a brown pole.
|-|Snow-Time=
[[Snow-Time Cosmetic Pack|Snow-Time]] Coal's back is white and fades into a pastel blue shade at her underside. Her snowflake cheek marks are light blue, rotated diagonally, and include a dot and cross in the markings, similarly to the marks behind her satchel. Her feet surrounded by white fluff and eyebrows are light blue like her markings, while her eyelids have shining, purple eyeshadow. She has two short, rock-like, horns on her forehead and tail, which have light blue-purple gradient, a fluffy base, a white, loopy line, and a white star and dot pattern rotating in a northwest direction, with one on the tail being shorter. Her satchel has white, fluffy lining on the sides of the strap and flaps as well as white, decorative loops and a rotating pattern. The pouches have rectangular, silver closures, and are mostly purple with a faint blend of pink and blue on top of them, while the strap is cyan with a bluer fade in the middle and has bars that are shiny and silver like the closures. She radiates light blue dots, sparkles, and asterisk-shaped snowflakes with two additional branches on each end. When moving, a line of more detailed dendrite snowflakes can be seen accompanied by smaller dots and crosses like the ones on her horn and satchel, along with a soft light green and magenta glow representing northern lights.
|-|Golden Dust=
Golden Dust Coal is brown with three white freckles instead of snowflake cheeks and has a splotch of gold dust on her back and tail with lighter, wavy squiggles along with white stars and dots varying in size. Her dark gray parts are now a darker brown, except for eyelids which are golden with two lighter lines each, giving them a shiny appearance. Her satchel is a brighter red with golden yellow stitching and rectangular closures without shines, with the golden bars bearing them instead. Her flag pole is a golden yellow without shines. Her flag is longer and more ribbon-like, and its design now consists of a gold yellow "X" and a trail of three dots. On the left side of her back, she has a golden crown with six points, a red oval ornamenting each. She also emits a faint golden glow, along with small golden twinkles
</tabber>

==Personality==
Coal always comes across as grumpy, frequently growling at a low tone. She generally isn't excited about many things, even including the holiday season (as shown in her dialogue with {{CI|Rudie|name=true}}, her [[Introduction Card]], and {{CI|Bobette|name=true}}'s [[gossip]] about her). She grows a little happier when {{CI|Cocoa|name=true}} promises her to give her treats, because Cocoa sees Coal tired and hungry when interacting with her. According to {{CI|Teagan|name=true}}, Coal is usually well-behaved (though this might only be because she isn't as hyperactive as her fellow dog friend {{CI|Pebble|name=true}}).

