==Requirement Strategies==
*For the first requirement, focus on picking up {{II|Ornaments|name=true}} and extracting [[Machines]]. The Machine and Ornament count increases the further you descend, so you can earn more Ornaments.
*For the second requirement, you can get Trinkets in two ways: Completing [[Twisteds]] Research or buying at [[Dandy's Store]], to do this, go on multiple runs and try to farm as much Ichor as possible, collecting Research Capsules or extracting machines, and if you can buy from Dandy's Store, start by the cheapest ones, like {{TI|Coin Purse|name=true}} and {{TI|Research Map|name=true}}.

